t="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M17.7 7.7A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 19.5 12H2M9.6 4.6A2 2 0 1 1 11 8H2M12.6 19.4A2 2 0 1 0 14 16H2"/></svg>Service 05</span><h2>Wind &amp; Microburst Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Downslope winds, microbursts and windstorms: shingles, siding, fences and fallen trees.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/property-claim-appraisal/water-frozen-pipe-appraisal/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/frozen-pipe.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/frozen-pipe-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/frozen-pipe.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 22a7 7 0 0 0 7-7c0-2-1-3.9-3-5.5s-3.5-4-4-6.5c-.5 2.5-2 4.9-4 6.5S5 13 5 15a7 7 0 0 0 7 7z"/></svg>Service 06</span><h2>Water &amp; Frozen Pipe Appraisal</h2><p>Burst pipes, supply-line failures and ice-dam leaks priced through drying and rebuild.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/property-claim-appraisal/fire-smoke-damage-appraisal/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/house-fire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="680" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M8.5 14.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 11 12c0-1.4-.5-2-1-3-1.1-2.1-.2-4 2-6 .5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5 2 1.6 3 3.5 3 5.5a7 7 0 1 1-14 0c0-1.2.4-2.3 1-3.4.4 1.4 1.4 2.4 2.5 2.4z"/></svg>Service 07</span><h2>Fire &amp; Smoke Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Structure fires, kitchen fires and smoke odor valued through cleaning or replacement.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/property-claim-appraisal/wildfire-claim-appraisal/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-ridge.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-ridge-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/wildfire-ridge.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="576" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 22v-5M7 17h10l-3-4h2l-4-5h1.5L12 3 8.5 8H10l-4 5h2z"/></svg>Service 08</span><h2>Wildfire Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Total losses, ember damage and lingering smoke for homes near Idaho’s forests and foothills.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/property-claim-appraisal/snow-load-ice-dam-appraisal/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/snow-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/snow-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/snow-roof.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="770" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 2v20M4.9 4.9l14.2 14.2M2 12h20M4.9 19.1L19.1 4.9M9 3l3 3 3-3M9 21l3-3 3 3M3 9l3 3-3 3M21 9l-3 3 3 3"/></svg>Service 09</span><h2>Snow Load &amp; Ice Dam Appraisal</h2><p>Collapsed roofs, cracked trusses and ice-dam leaks after heavy Idaho winters.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/property-claim-appraisal/claim-estimate-review/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop-docs.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-docs-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop-docs.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="638" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h5"/></svg>Service 10</span><h2>Insurance Estimate Review</h2><p>A line-by-line read of the carrier’s estimate before you decide on next steps.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/property-claim-appraisal/appraisal-umpire-services/"><span class="icard-img"><img src="/assets/img/photos/meeting-room.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/meeting-room-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/meeting-room.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><span class="icard-k"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3v18M7 21h10M5 7h14M5 7l-3 7a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 6 0zM19 7l-3 7a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 6 0z"/></svg>Service 11</span><h2>Umpire Services</h2><p>Neutral umpire work for Idaho appraisal panels that can’t reach agreement.</p></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap faq-in"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker dark">Not sure where to start?</p><h2>Most claims begin with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone demands appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the insurer’s estimate falls short and what that gap is worth. A review answers that in days, and many disputes end there.</p><a class="btn btn-navy" href="/property-claim-appraisal/claim-estimate-review/">About estimate reviews <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for just one part of the process?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Many clients start with an estimate review and decide later whether to demand appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle farm and ranch buildings?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Barns, shops, storage buildings and other agricultural structures are a regular part of our work.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you only work on storm claims?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>No. We also handle fire, wildfire, water, snow-load and other covered losses.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-strip"><div class="wrap cta-in rv"><div><h2>Not sure the payout covers the repair?</h2><p>Send the insurer’s estimate. We’ll read it line by line and tell you what we see.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-y" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-line-w" href="/schedule-a-consult/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
